        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በላዩ ፡ ላይ ፡ እጁን ፡ ጫነበት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ከመ ፡ ይርአይ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብርሃን ፡ ያይ ፡ ዘንድ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": "፲፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፫ ፤ ⟪ወአውሥአ ፡ ሐናንያ ፡ ወይቤ ፡ እግዚኦ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰማዕኩ ፡ በእንተ ፡ ውእቱ ፡ ብእሲ ፡ በኀበ ፡ ብዙኃን ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አውሥአ ፡ ለላይኛው ፡ ነው ፡ ሐናንያም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የዚያን ፡ ሰው ፡ ነገር ፡ ከብዙ ፡ ሰዎች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰምቻለሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ኵሎ ፡ ዘይገብር ፡ እኩየ ፡ ዲበ ፡ ቅዱሳኒከ ፡ በኢየሩ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሳሌም ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኢየሩሳሌም ፡ ባሉ ፡ ምእመናን ፡ ላይ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይሠራው ፡ የነበረውን ፡ ክፉ ፡ ሥራ፡ ሁሉ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከብዙ ፡ ሰዎች ፡ ሰምቻለሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": "፲፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፬ ፤ ⟪ወዝየኒ ፡ አስተብዊሖ ፡ በኀበ ፡ ሊቀ ፡ ካህናት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መጽአ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሊቃነ ፡ ካህናት ፡ ዘንድ ፡ ሂዶ ፡ ቃስድ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነት ፡ ሹመት ፡ ተካሶ ፡ ከዚህ ፡ እንደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መጣ ፡ ሰምቻለሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ከመ ፡ ይሞቅሖሙ ፡ ለኵሎሙ ፡ እለ ፡ ይጼውዑ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስመከ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስምህን ፡ የሚጠሩ ፡ በስምህ ፡ ያመኑ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምእመናንን ፡ እያሠረ ፡ ይወስዳቸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
